{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this co-op adventure, team up with your long-eyed alien friends. After a crash, you're trapped in a 'Fault Line'. To find a way out and send a signal home, you must explore, climb, and overcome dangers together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/110566704285929dc5a0a3933222183a.poster.avif?t=1768927505\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/110566704285929dc5a0a3933222183a.webm?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/110566704285929dc5a0a3933222183a.mp4?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HELP... OR HINDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/a6162374f8a70c891e77aca8180ddfb1.poster.avif?t=1768927505\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/a6162374f8a70c891e77aca8180ddfb1.webm?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperation is the only way out of this 'Fault Line'... or is it? Give your friends a boost to help them climb, slide, and dodge dangers. Or, you know, arrange a little &quot;accident&quot; that sends them right back to the bottom. Trust is a luxury here\u2014the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIGNAL HOME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/865c36e4bafad23d560ba27a131ee926.poster.avif?t=1768927505\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/865c36e4bafad23d560ba27a131ee926.webm?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/865c36e4bafad23d560ba27a131ee926.mp4?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The signal device from your escape pod is your only hope. But to get it to work, you need to reach the highest point of the 'Fault Line'. Set up the device, test the signal, and constantly aim higher to get that call out. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DANGER AROUND EVERY CORNER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/2303b290e4d2785012ee54fac238df22.poster.avif?t=1768927505\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/2303b290e4d2785012ee54fac238df22.webm?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything on this planet is friendly. Try not to get eaten by sound-sensitive plants, avoid flora that shoots pollen at you, and... whatever you do, don't wake up that 'Sleeping Rock'. Seriously. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALIEN GADGETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/00ae3fa030a433f64e1cfd2572d75fd9.poster.avif?t=1768927505\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/00ae3fa030a433f64e1cfd2572d75fd9.webm?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/00ae3fa030a433f64e1cfd2572d75fd9.mp4?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, you didn't come empty-handed. Use your Jetpack for short bursts, clear paths with the Gravity Gun, and make quick escapes with the Teleporter. But most importantly: always check your 'Nitrogen' tank. That's not oxygen you're breathing, and if it runs out... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Adventure:</strong> Try to escape the 'Fault Line' with friends or solo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/27a1a56df3fea046ee1cb0aa92ae39ea.poster.avif?t=1768927505\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/27a1a56df3fea046ee1cb0aa92ae39ea.webm?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/27a1a56df3fea046ee1cb0aa92ae39ea.mp4?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Physics:</strong> Help your friends or make their lives miserable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.poster.avif?t=1768927505\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.webm?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.mp4?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical World:</strong> Fluid movement mechanics built on climbing, sliding, and dodging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/6c511d0e53b237c838f1421f5a20894e.poster.avif?t=1768927505\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/6c511d0e53b237c838f1421f5a20894e.webm?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/6c511d0e53b237c838f1421f5a20894e.mp4?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous Flora:</strong> Unpredictable plant and rock enemies that react to sound and touch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/2303b290e4d2785012ee54fac238df22.poster.avif?t=1768927505\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/2303b290e4d2785012ee54fac238df22.webm?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien Tech:</strong> Vital gear including a Jetpack, Gravity Gun, Headlight, and Teleporter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/f79e4e12d424a1f4639352cf9a650dee.poster.avif?t=1768927505\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/f79e4e12d424a1f4639352cf9a650dee.webm?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nitrogen Management:</strong> It's not Oxygen! Manage your breathable air carefully, or suffocate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Search for a Signal:</strong> A constant goal to climb higher and find a way to call home.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3970800?t=1768927505","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/f46752a2d84e78d0ebc9689a869efaa1d3212f7e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768927505","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/3dcbeaa69cf87f5768ab76adcc32ea20a26b4104/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768927505","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/3dcbeaa69cf87f5768ab76adcc32ea20a26b4104/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768927505","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mild fantasy violence and adventure elements. There is no blood, strong language, sexual content, or drug use. The focus is on exploration and survival in a mysterious world. Suitable for younger audiences as well as adults."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this co-op adventure, team up with your long-eyed alien friends. After a crash, you're trapped in a 'Fault