apps/3970800/extras/00ae3fa030a433f64e1cfd2572d75fd9.mp4?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, you didn't come empty-handed. Use your Jetpack for short bursts, clear paths with the Gravity Gun, and make quick escapes with the Teleporter. But most importantly: always check your 'Nitrogen' tank. That's not oxygen you're breathing, and if it runs out... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Adventure:</strong> Try to escape the 'Fault Line' with friends or solo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/27a1a56df3fea046ee1cb0aa92ae39ea.poster.avif?t=1768927505\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/27a1a56df3fea046ee1cb0aa92ae39ea.webm?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/27a1a56df3fea046ee1cb0aa92ae39ea.mp4?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Physics:</strong> Help your friends or make their lives miserable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.poster.avif?t=1768927505\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.webm?t=1768927505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.mp